      "id": "2066823094988427439",
      "text": "Everyone's upset about Fable 5. But can we talk about what Opus 4.8 just did?\n\nIt one-shotted an AI badminton scorekeeper.\n\nPoint your phone at the court. It tracks the shuttlecock. Keeps score. And tells you exactly how hard you're hitting it.\n\nStop mourning. Start building.\n\n⚡ Stay ahead of AI. Follow @aiecosystemhq right now.\n\n#AI #Claude #Opus48 #ComputerVision",
      "author": {
